          "source_span": {
            "end_line": 307,
            "start_line": 304
          }
        }
      },
      "source": [
        "We use ordinary least squares to estimate the coefficient values of $\\beta_0$\n",
        "and $\\beta_1$. This is performed on the data of the estimation set\n",
        "`USSteamCoEstim`, as introduced in the manuscript estimation-period figure. A brief summary of the model\n",
        "is obtained from the fitted statsmodels object.\n"
      ]
