      },
      "source": [
        "The estimate of the intercept $\\beta_0$ is $b_0 = 4,897,663$, and the estimate of the slope $\\beta_1$ is $b_1 = 18.99$. In practical terms, this baseline model estimates expected revenue from production alone. Before relying on it, we still need to inspect fit, residuals, and whether other available variables improve the estimate.\n"
      ]
