      "source": [
        "In addition to the brief model output, the full summary provides insight into\n",
        "the residuals (minimum, first quartile, median, third quartile, and maximum),\n",
        "the $t$ and $p$-values of each of the coefficients and their significance, the\n",
        "adjusted $r^2$, and the $F$ statistic with its $p$-value.\n"
