            "start_line": 377
          }
        }
      },
      "source": [
        "A stepwise AIC helper can be used to implement both backward and forward\n",
        "methods. The `direction` argument specifies whether the stepwise algorithm\n",
        "should proceed forward (`forward`), backward (`backward`), or both (`both`). The\n",
        "candidate terms define the range of models to be searched.\n"
      ]
